		{
			dependencies: ["3D862A3D3F83CA26"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#7FD8C9 to=#C9F4EC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>附魔锻造炉</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你已建造的基座环，坐落在一个替你按下按钮的底座上，</grad><grad from=#8BE0FF to=#4FB8E8 f=0.8></grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#7FD8C9 to=#C9F4EC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>建造</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>三乘三的 </grad><grad from=#8BE0FF to=#4FB8E8 f=0.8>源石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。九块方块中有四块是控制器及其端口。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>顶部是：</grad><grad from=#8BE0FF to=#4FB8E8 f=0.8>附魔装置，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>中间，</grad><grad from=#8BE0FF to=#4FB8E8 f=0.8>八个神秘基座</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>环绕四周。这是模组自带的环形结构，未作改动。你已经建造过这个形状一百次了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 拥有戒指就是全部要求。无需先刷取任何新物品。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#7FD8C9 to=#C9F4EC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>偿还源头</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>没有源管道。配方需要源的地方，会改用 </grad><grad from=#8BE0FF to=#4FB8E8 f=0.8>源宝石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，每五百个一个，而这正是浸染室制造一个所需收取的费用。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Apparatus建造的绝大部分东西都完全免费，</grad><grad from=#8BE0FF to=#4FB8E8 f=0.8>所以通常不会出现这种情况。</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#7FD8C9 to=#C9F4EC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>喂食</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将试剂放入 </grad><grad from=#8BE0FF to=#4FB8E8 f=0.8>物品端口</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，每边十二个槽位</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8BE0FF to=#4FB8E8 f=0.8>每次合成消耗 5000 FE</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>十秒半，和Apparatus手动所需时间相同</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 从试剂中继承附魔效果的物品并不在此。附魔者装备、法师长袍、法术弓和扭曲卷轴仍需真正的Apparatus。"
				""
				"[!note] 在 JEI 中查找控制器以获取完整列表。"
			]
			icon: "linggango_tweaks:enchanting_forge"
			id: "1CB72C8D32F74AAA"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [{
				id: "09584B22AA58803B"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 100
			}]
			shape: "octagon"
			size: 1.2d
			subtitle: "巫师挂机农场"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "118A774309A6FE29"
					item: "linggango_tweaks:enchanting_forge"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "65CF96E70DAC5121"
					item: "linggango_tweaks:enchanting_forge_item_input"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "附魔锻造台"
			x: 0.5d
			y: -8.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5766C8B9E850C186"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#7FD8C9 to=#C9F4EC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>源熔炉</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>灌注室，以及为其供能的</grad><grad from=#8BE0FF to=#4FB8E8 f=0.8>四个罐子，均可自行运行。</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#7FD8C9 to=#C9F4EC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>建造</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>三乘三的 </grad><grad from=#8BE0FF to=#4FB8E8 f=0.8>源石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。其中四块是控制器及其端口。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>顶部和角落是 </grad><grad from=#8BE0FF to=#4FB8E8 f=0.8>源容器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，边缘是 </grad><grad from=#8BE0FF to=#4FB8E8 f=0.8>神秘基座</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，而中间是一个真正的 </grad><grad from=#8BE0FF to=#4FB8E8 f=0.8>灌注室</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 这些罐子就是你平时手动喂食用的那些。这里没有任何消耗品。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#7FD8C9 to=#C9F4EC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>来源</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用 </grad><grad from=#8BE0FF to=#4FB8E8 f=0.8>源宝石 </grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>支付，每颗五百，本密室的标准价。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"廉价配方消耗不到一整颗宝石。有时消耗一颗宝石，平均下来正好。每十个配方中，有一个会消耗一颗源石。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#7FD8C9 to=#C9F4EC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>喂食</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将试剂放入 </grad><grad from=#8BE0FF to=#4FB8E8 f=0.8>物品端口</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，每边十二个槽位</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad><grad from=#8BE0FF to=#4FB8E8 f=0.8>每次合成消耗 5000 FE</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>廉价品五秒，大师印记五十秒。和手工熔炼所需时间相同。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 紫水晶和青金石无法在源宝石中转换。这里会是一进一出。请在真正的熔炉中制作宝石。"
				""
				"[!note] 在 JEI 中查找控制器以获取完整列表。"
			]
